BTW did anyone ever use Bounding Volumes for Enveloping? I'm thinking of creating a advanced unit_template for faster enveloping. For people who don't know what it is:
I create a cube and resize it so it roughly 'contains' all points which are usually weighted to the head. Then I assign this cube to bone_head. The next time you envelope to bone_head, all the points 'engulfed' by the cube will be assigned to bone_head.

